Third-party parts
- HIT BOX drawer (source/toolkit/hitbox_ps2.py and the HIT BOX part of the PS2 patch): based on the code of Vans (vans1belmont,
  https://github.com/vans1belmont/kofxi-international), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, used and modified with his permission.
  The hitbox colours and draw order follow the hitbox viewer of odabugs (https://github.com/odabugs).
- source/arcade/hacks/aw_crypto.py: cipher tables ported from MAME, BSD-3-Clause (see the header of that file).

